      "writtenOn": "2025-05-07T10:29:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For our scenario we don\u0027t need to update caches at all since we run offline reindexing in a separate pod and when this finished we only copy the new index version to seed the bulk of the new index version into the gerrit primary pods. There we enable online reindexing with index.reuseExistingDocuments \u003d true` to catch up by only reindexing new or recently updated changes. Here we don\u0027t need to disable caches since the old changes have already been reindexed in the previous offline reindexing done in a dedicated reindexing pod.",
